# ============================================================
# 换行符策略
# ============================================================
# 仓库内一律存 LF。Windows 上开发、Linux 上部署，
# 若 .sh / systemd unit / nginx conf 被存成 CRLF，
# 在服务器上会报 "bad interpreter" 或配置解析失败。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专属脚本保持 CRLF（cmd.exe 对 LF 的批处理解析不稳）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# ============================================================
# 二进制，不做换行符转换
# ============================================================
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.p12 binary
*.pfx binary
*.pem binary
*.key binary

